# Shiroe Aider config example.
# Copy to .aider.conf.yml only if you use Aider for this repository.

read:
  - AGENTS.md
  - SOUL.md
  - PRIVACY.md
  - REDACT.md
  - SHARING_POLICY.md

auto-commits: false

# Shiroe is model-agnostic. Choose models in Aider according to your local
# environment and task risk.
# model:
# weak-model:
